                                U.K.)</cell>
                            <cell role="num">30 ea.</cell>
                            <cell role="num">$75,000</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Sherman tanks (in transit from
                                U.K.)</cell>
